---
description: Never add Cursor attribution to git commits
alwaysApply: true
---

When creating git commits for this project:

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor attribution trailer.
- Use plain commit messages only, e.g. `git commit -m "message"` or `git commit -F <file>`.
- Do not use `--trailer` flags for Cursor attribution.
- Commits must appear as **AseelHerzallah1** only.
